 :open-questions
 [{:id :lazy-sowman-empty-sow-action
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-94-lazy-sowman]
   :question "May Lazy Sowman use Grain Utilization solely to decline Sow, without sowing or baking, including when no sowing plan is possible?"
   :current-behavior "A board placement must still perform a legal action. Declining Sow completes Cultivation when a field is plowed, or Grain Utilization when bread is baked; otherwise the uncommitted placement is cancelled. Generic Sow offers without sowing potential are omitted."
   :status :unresolved
   :sources ["https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
             "https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/2108049/article/30659621#30659621"
             "https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/2323856/about-decline-an-action-instead-an-action-or-some"
             "https://www.reedstonefood.com/agricola/compendium"]
   :note "The older mixed-edition compendium permits an empty Bake/Sow action, while community discussion conflicts. The Revised compendium cites Uwe via Ponton for repeated Cultivation, but the linked primary post could not be retrieved. Existing behavior is an interpretation, not a verified designer ruling on empty Sow actions."}
  {:id :fertilizers-and-moldboard-action-boundary
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-73-agricultural-fertilizers :revised-base/b019]
   :question "Does Farmland's field plus Moldboard Plow's additional field count as one action for Agricultural Fertilizers?"
   :current-behavior "The two plow effects are treated separately; one field from each does not grant a Sow action."
   :status :unresolved
   :note "No explicit publisher or designer clarification was found. Do not present either interpretation as a verified ruling."}]
 :regressions
 [{:id :original-e-printed-cost-corrections :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-11-field :catalog/original-base-e-24-animal-pen]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Original Field costs one food; Animal Pen costs two wood. Catalogue omissions must not make them free."
   :test agricola.original-cards-test/printed-prerequisites-and-costs-are-enforced-before-play}
  {:id :original-source-wood :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-34-basket :catalog/original-base-e-196-mushroom-collector]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Original return-to-pile effects share the wood actually taken from the space; existing supply and extra card income cannot supply the returned wood. Revised reprints instead permit an exchange from supply."
   :test agricola.original-e-minors-extra-test/basket-and-mushroom-collector-cannot-return-the-same-source-wood}
  {:id :original-stablehand-once :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-207-stablehand]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Stablehand grants at most one stable per turn, including fencing initiated by Mini Pasture."
   :test agricola.original-cards-test/stablehand-builds-once-per-turn-including-after-mini-pasture}
  {:id :original-hedge-keeper-mini-pasture :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-175-hedge-keeper :catalog/original-base-e-40-mini-pasture]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Original Hedge Keeper supplies up to three additional fences once per turn, after a first fence supplied by the player or another card. Mini Pasture's fences and the extra fences are validated together."
   :test agricola.original-fencing-test/mini-pasture-validates-the-complete-pasture-layout}
  {:id :original-bakers-oven :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-14-bakers-oven]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Baker's Oven returns an oven, not any baking improvement. Returned major ovens reenter the supply; the new oven bakes at most two grain for five food each per baking action. Other retained ovens can also bake."
   :test agricola.original-e-minors-extra-test/bakers-oven-immediate-bake-uses-the-new-oven-and-other-retained-ovens}
  {:id :original-edition-scoring :cards [:catalog/original-base-e-23-manger :catalog/original-base-e-197-braggart]
   :source "https://agricola.no/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/compendium.pdf"
   :rule "Original Manger awards 1/2/3/4 points at 6/7/8/9 pasture spaces; original Braggart awards 1/3/5/7/9 at 5/6/7/8/9 improvements."
   :test agricola.original-cards-test/original-scoring-thresholds}
  {:id :lodger-person-supply-and-choice
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-127-lodger]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Lodger expires at returning home in round nine; a person removed for lacking other accommodation can never grow back."
   :implementation-assumption "Without a card-specific ruling about room assignment, a player with both adult and newborn people chooses which occupied the temporary room. The saved mandatory choice updates newborn feeding and permanently reduces person supply."
   :test agricola.artifex-temporary-test/lodger-saves-a-choice-between-an-adult-and-newborn-occupant}
  {:id :stable-planner-supply-reservations
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-89-stable-planner]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Stable Planner reserves physical stable pieces; they cannot be built early, and their preparation-phase construction does not trigger own-turn stable bonuses."
   :test agricola.artifex-temporary-test/stable-planner-reserves-physical-pieces-until-their-rounds}
  {:id :woolgrower-completed-feeding
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-148-woolgrower]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Woolgrower counts completed shared feeding phases, including those before it was played; the new sheep space is available for the following breeding phase."
   :test agricola.woolgrower-test/woolgrower-new-capacity-is-usable-during-the-same-harvest}
  {:id :baking-sheet-requires-normal-baking
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-30-baking-sheet]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Baking Sheet permits one optional extra grain exchange after normal baking; it cannot supply the required baking itself."
   :test agricola.baking-sheet-test/baking-sheet-triggers-once-per-bake-and-after-an-ovens-granted-bake}
  {:id :construction-family-growth-once
   :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-21-family-friend-home :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-93-bed-maker]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Family Friend Home and Bed Maker each offer one family growth action per room-building action, regardless of room count. Family Friend Home requires spare rooms before construction."
   :test agricola.artifex-construction-test/bed-maker-is-one-paid-growth-per-room-action}
  {:id :work-certificate-immediate-use :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-82-work-certificate]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Work Certificate may trigger on the action used to play it. The specific card entry and 2022 revision supersede the compendium's older generic timing example."
   :test agricola.artifex-board-test/work-certificate-triggers-on-its-own-play-and-on-card-spaces}
  {:id :limited-sowing-is-not-unconditional :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-65-seed-pellets :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-79-garden-hoe :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-115-chief-forester]
   :source "https://www.lookout-spiele.de/upload/de_agricolare.html_Appendix_Agricola-RE_EN.pdf"
   :authority :publisher :page 5
   :rule "A Sow action restricted to one field is not unconditional and does not activate effects that require unconditional sowing."
   :test agricola.sowing-cards-test/chief-forester-is-one-field-and-not-unconditional-even-on-riverbank}
  {:id :field-cards-scoring :cards [:revised-base/b068]
   :source "https://www.lookout-spiele.de/upload/de_agricolare.html_Appendix_Agricola-RE_EN.pdf"
   :authority :publisher :page 11
   :rule "Only farmyard field tiles earn field-tile points. Crops on field cards still contribute to crop scoring."
   :test agricola.engine-test/field-cards-score-crops-but-not-field-tile-points}
  {:id :fields-and-field-tiles :cards [:revised-base/b068 :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-70-lifting-machine :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-72-calcium-fertilizers]
   :source "https://www.lookout-spiele.de/upload/de_agricolare.html_Appendix_Agricola-RE_EN.pdf"
   :authority :publisher :page 3
   :rule "Field prerequisites include cards that identify themselves as fields. Field-tile prerequisites count only tiles on the farmyard board."
   :test agricola.artifex-crop-test/field-card-prerequisites-distinguish-fields-from-field-tiles}
  {:id :winnowing-fan-after-field-phase :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-61-winnowing-fan :revised-base/a112]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Winnowing Fan resolves after field-phase effects and converts one grain using a baking improvement without a Bake Bread action."
   :test agricola.artifex-crop-test/winnowing-fan-waits-for-the-end-of-the-field-phase}
  {:id :wood-worker-funds-cultivator :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-164-wood-worker :catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-91-shifting-cultivator]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Wood Worker resolves during use; its sheep may be cooked to fund Shifting Cultivator. Basket and Mushroom Collector resolve later."
   :test agricola.artifex-interactions-test/wood-worker-can-fund-shifting-cultivator-with-cooked-sheep}
  {:id :wooden-shed-major-action :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-10-wooden-shed]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Wooden Shed requires a major improvement action and a wooden house; mandatory renovation happens before an improvement on House Redevelopment."
   :test agricola.artifex-interactions-test/wooden-shed-needs-an-authenticated-major-action}
  {:id :homekeeper-adjacency :cards [:catalog/revised-artifex-expansion-a-85-homekeeper]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "The same clay or stone room must border a field tile and a pasture; field cards cannot supply adjacency."
   :test agricola.artifex-interactions-test/homekeeper-tests-one-rooms-actual-adjacency}
  {:id :scholar-immediate-plow-driver-and-groom :cards [:revised-base/a090 :revised-base/b089]
   :source "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :unofficial-compilation
   :rule "Plow Driver and Groom played by Scholar can be used immediately in that preparation phase."
   :test agricola.card-timing-test/newly-played-scholar-effects-use-the-current-round-window}
  {:id :scholar-start-of-round :cards [:revised-base/b097]
   :source "https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/2505218/b097-scholar"
   :cross-reference "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WUl0HlzX6Yx0ume75UmpaIMhoHukx9XufM_LbV1oZ6E/edit"
   :authority :community-clarification-of-printed-text
   :rule "Scholar acts at round start; Well income is available."
   :limitation "The Small-scale Farmer test is specific to that card. Plow Driver and Groom have separately tested same-window exceptions. Manservant schedules only future rounds."
   :test agricola.card-game-test/scholar-uses-current-printing-round-start-timing}
  {:id :scholar-manservant :cards [:revised-base/b097 :revised-base/b107]
